kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992530/ss_76c02680c3c9ba3fa95f0a5058a5fa82626e26e4.600x338.jpg?t=1763417654"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992530/ss_c5b8257c6d925b969d010bc6135f466646b91d98.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763417654","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992530/ss_c5b8257c6d925b969d010bc6135f466646b91d98.600x338.jpg?t=1763417654"}],"short_description":"Party Words is a word party game with a bunch of different game modes and a ton of words to keep it fresh! Pass and play with a single device or join multiple devices to unlock new possibilities. Who's the fastest guesser? Who has all the ideas? Whose doodles are the best? Find out with Party Words.","steam_appid":1992530,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://partywords.kelsam.net/#contact"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://partywords.kelsam.net//"}